          %h2#comparisons Comparisons
          %h3#NSAvsSDG Invertible infinitesimals in NSA and SDG
          %p
            All the infinitesimals appearing in nonstandard analysis are
            = succeed "," do
              %em invertible
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hyperreal+numbers"} hyperreal numbers
            form a
